   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone, <div>It&#39;s been a while I have been trying to enable the gzip compression on my nginx for my shiny server. But no success so far, no matter how much I have read the tutorials or how many different thing I have tried. Is there anybody know how to enable that ?</div><div>Thanks</div><div><br></div><div>This is how my configuration looks like:</div><div><div><b>/etc/nginx/nginx.conf</b></div></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">http {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>##</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span># Basic Settings</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>##</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>client_max_body_size 1000M;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>sendfile on;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>tcp_nopush on;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>tcp_nodelay on;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>client_body_timeout 30;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>client_header_timeout 30;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>send_timeout 10;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>keepalive_disable none;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>types_hash_max_size 2048;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip on;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_disable &quot;msie6&quot;;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_vary on;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_proxied any;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_comp_level 6;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_buffers 16 8k;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_http_version 1.1;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_min_length 256;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gzip_types text/plain text/css application/json application/x-javascript text/xml application/xml application/xml+rss text/javascript application/vnd.ms-fontobject application/x-font-ttf font/opentype image/svg+xml image/x-icon;</font></div><div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>include /etc/nginx/conf.d/*.conf;</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>include /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/*;</div><div>}</div></div></div></code></div><br><b><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/defualt</span><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">server {</font></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"><font color=\"#660066\">\t</font></span></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>listen   80; ## listen for ipv4; this line is default and implied</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>#listen   [::]:80 default ipv6only=on; ## listen for ipv6</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>root /usr/share/nginx/www;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>index index.php index.html index.htm;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span># Make site accessible from <a href=\"http://localhost/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://localhost/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391099797000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2JCOQ7rQeGuRqme8TKu8M4\">http://localhost/</a></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>server_name localhost;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>location /shiny/ {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  rewrite ^(/shiny/[^/]+)$ $1/ permanent;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  proxy_pass <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:3838/shiny/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:3838/shiny/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391099797000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-D4S3HyjZl1YtXKwNx3bM\">http://127.0.0.1:3838/shiny/</a>;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    proxy_http_version 1.1;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">            proxy_read_timeout 20d;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">             keepalive_disable none;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">             proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">             proxy_set_header Connection &quot;upgrade&quot;;</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</font></div><div style=\"font-family:monospace\">}</div></div></code></div><br><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
